		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3669&amp;p=35486#p35486"><![CDATA[
<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Can someone please provide download link for this experimental firmware again?<br><br>Tried flashing my UV390 (Plus, 10W, GPS), now getting a black display, used MD9600-CSV(2571V5)-V26.45.bin as the donor file and OpenMDUV380_10W_PLUS.zip for firmware. All details are the same for me as explained at this post: <br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?t=3837" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?t=3837</a><br>"TYT MD-UV390 Plus"<br>"Post by kc1ueb » Sun Mar 03, 2024 5:31 am"<br><br>I have the hope the experimental firmware could solve it. Any help are welcome in advance! <br><br>(I made backup, but restore process crashes <img class="smilies" src="http://localhost/opengd77/images/smilies/icon_e_sad.gif" width="15" height="17" alt=":-(" title="Sad"> )<br><blockquote class="uncited"><div>With information from KK7QLA we I now know that the LCD backlight control signal is on MCU / CPU pin PC6, this pin is used as the PA band select control in the original UV380<br><br>At the moment I don't know what pin now controls the PA band select, but assuming that the LCD backlight and the PA band select pins have been swapped,  <br><br>I have build a version where the PA band select now uses pin PD8, which is my current best guess about what pins are controlling the PA band select<br><br><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/MDUV380_DM1701/Firmware/Experimental/6e2e9ada6e75ce23912c2e07af3205a9922d9d6c/OpenMDUV380_PLUS.bin" class="postlink">downloads/MDUV380_DM1701/Firmware/Exper ... 0_PLUS.bin</a><br><br>...</div></blockquote></div></blockquote>This is a very old thread about something that was fixed nearly 12 months ago.<br><br>Assuming you have installed the latest Beta. Please post to the thread about that Beta.<br><br>If you didn't install the latest Beta, you should try that now.<br><br>This thread is now locked<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Thu Jan 30, 2025 9:14 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
